+
+## Due times
+
+When `DUE_TIMES=on`, every ticket includes `due`, an ISO UTC timestamp set from its creation time and priority.
+It remains fixed across priority edits and configuration changes. `GET /tickets?overdue=true` restricts the usual
+cursor listing to open and in-progress tickets with `due` strictly before now; all other filters still combine.
+`overdue=false` applies no restriction; other values return 400. With the feature off, the parameter is ignored as before.
